<title>USA: State of Washington COPs adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>State of Washington COPs adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Susan D. Musselman Inc, financial advisor for the $1.190 million State of Washington certificate sale said it recalculated U.S. Bank of Washington's winning bid.  U.S. Bank's winning true interest cost is 4.40994 percent, not the 4.42 percent originally calculated.</p>
